1	/**
2	 * DatabaseProvider - Platform-aware database selection
3	 *
4	 * Automatically selects best backend:
5	 * - Linux/macOS: better-sqlite3 (native, fast)
6	 * - Windows: sql.js (WASM, universal) when native fails
7	 * - Fallback: JSON file storage
8	 *
9	 * @module v3/memory/database-provider
10	 */
